@title EMC fix-it: move a sensitive device away from a drive, preview and apply
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The analog module stands against the drive on the plate (EMC-17). Check > EMC check offers "Preview: Move it to the nearest free spot". The preview moves a copy: EMC-17 goes and says what was not checked (heat, airflow, door swing, wire lengths). Apply is one undo step. The pictures are the evidence.
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc check
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
expect "Preview: Move it to the nearest free spot"
click_text "Preview: Move it to the nearest free spot" #1
wait 10
expect "Preview on a copy of the project"
expect "Clears EMC-17"
expect "not heat, airflow"
shot 01-preview
check_layout
click_text "Apply (one undo step)" #1
wait 15
expect "nearest free spot"
expect_not "Preview on a copy of the project"
shot 02-applied
check_layout
key Escape
wait 12
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
key Home
wait 15
shot 03-plate-after
check_layout
